{"id":"0d2469f2990d6f49","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-reflection-formula.md","title":"Reflection Formula","display":"df-reflection-formula — Reflection Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-reflection-formula","aliases":["89-df-reflection-formula"],"display":"df-reflection-formula — Reflection Formula","depends_on":["[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","[[89-df-reflection-principle]]","[[89-df-godel-numbering]]","[[89-df-numeral]]"],"revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-reflection-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-reflection-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-reflection-formula — Reflection Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"841985de31202f85\" href=\"?note=841985de31202f85\" title=\"89-df-provability-predicate\">89-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"396f9d3c403d0603\" href=\"?note=396f9d3c403d0603\" title=\"89-df-reflection-principle\">89-df-reflection-principle</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7f53d84c2164d9c5\" href=\"?note=7f53d84c2164d9c5\" title=\"89-df-godel-numbering\">89-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d088b00b91690ba0\" href=\"?note=d088b00b91690ba0\" title=\"89-df-numeral\">89-df-numeral</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathcal L_T=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_T=\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L_T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_T=\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L_T)\\)</span> 为所依赖可证性接口的固定语言和句子域；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_T\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_T\\)</span> 为递归可枚举算术理论，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_T\\)</span>、证明编码和数词均取同一固定环境；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"841985de31202f85\" href=\"?note=841985de31202f85\" title=\"89-df-provability-predicate\">89-df-provability-predicate</a> 的既有接口。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_T:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sent}_T)\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_T:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sent}_T)\\)</span> 是调用环境原指定的句法类族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_T(n)=\\Sigma_n^0(T)\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_T(n)=\\Sigma_n^0(T)\\)</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span> 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。本条保留每一层原选的句法类，不将其另换为可证等价闭包、真句集合或自然数集合的外延层级。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma_n^0}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma_n^0}(T)\\)</span> 隐含的族参数始终是同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_T\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_T\\)</span>。本定义不预设相邻层包含；使用层级命题时另须满足其对所有层的包含前提。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma^{0}_{n}}(T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\n\\ \\middle|\\ \\varphi\\in\\Sigma^{0}_{n}(T)\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma^{0}_{n}}(T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\n\\ \\middle|\\ \\varphi\\in\\Sigma^{0}_{n}(T)\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma_n^0}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma_n^0}(T)\\)</span> : 理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0\">\\(\\Sigma_n^0\\)</span> 局部反射模式</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0\">\\(\\Sigma_n^0\\)</span> : 算术层级第<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>层句子</li>\n<li>这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0(T)\">\\(\\Sigma_n^0(T)\\)</span> 是公式的句法类，不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 子集的外延类。</li>\n<li>每个模式实例断言：若某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0\">\\(\\Sigma_n^0\\)</span> 句子可证，则该句子成立。</li>\n<li>不同层级反射形成层级结构</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"841985de31202f85","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-reflection-principle","status":"resolved","id":"396f9d3c403d0603","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-reflection-principle]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"7f53d84c2164d9c5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"d088b00b91690ba0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"841985de31202f85","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L_T=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}$、$\\mathrm{Sent}_T=\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L_T)$ 为所依赖可证性接口的固定语言和句子域；$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_T$ 为递归可枚举算术理论，$\\mathrm{Prov}_T$、$\\mathrm{Sent}_T$、证明编码和数词均取同一固定环境；$\\mathrm{Prov}_T$ 使用 [[89-df-provability-predicate]] 的既有接口。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_T=\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L_T)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_T:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sent}_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_T(n)=\\Sigma_n^0(T)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma_n^0}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma^{0}_{n}}(T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\n\\ \\middle|\\ \\varphi\\in\\Sigma^{0}_{n}(T)\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma_n^0}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n^0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n^0","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n^0(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n^0","display":false}],"bytes":1937,"backlinks":[{"id":"da4d48b529c5f7d2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a3a661ee56e37de5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_T$ 为递归可枚举算术理论；$\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_T:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sent}_T)$ 和 $\\Sigma_n^0(T)=\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_T(n)$ 取 [[89-df-reflection-formula]] 的同一族，所有反射实例使用同一 $\\mathrm{Prov}_T$ 和同一编码。"},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-169","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-reflection-formula]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-30","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-reflection-principle]]／[[89-df-reflection-formula]] → [[89-prop-reflection-hierarchy]]：固定语言与句法类族，并把层级包含前提量化到全部层。"}],"outgoing":["841985de31202f85","396f9d3c403d0603","7f53d84c2164d9c5","d088b00b91690ba0"]}